<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Ultrainfo (converted from the organizer's CalTopo course map export)" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Forgotten Florida 100 mile course</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates copy the 4,431-point "Forgotten Florida 100 mile" line from Run Bum Tours' CalTopo map (caltopo.com/m/8U811), exported 2026-08-13 and linked from the Runners Handbook as the 100 MILE COURSE MAP. Point to point from Shane Kelly Park in Oviedo to the Tosohatchee Wildlife Management Area finish, measuring 98.3 miles against the handbook matrix's 98.85 (which includes the 1-mile St Nicholas shuttle ride across Highway 50). Station waypoints are the organizer's markers; the Wheeler Road and 50-mile-turnaround waypoints reuse the organizer's crew-access and finish markers. The line carries no elevations.</desc>
    <link href="https://caltopo.com/m/8U811"><text>Forgotten Florida 100 mile CalTopo map</text></link>
  </metadata>
